<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Tumblr Girls (feat. Christoph Andersson)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">G-Eazy, Christoph Andersson</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">These Things Happen</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3uAgHKnp9NtuWCRdnpI5U5</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.910" end="00:35.450">'Cause I'm in love with these Tumblr girls, with skinny waists and - habits</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.450" end="00:38.900">Pretty faces love status, she acts as if she's the baddest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.900" end="00:43.380">Man, I swear she's just like tons of girls, she expects the free drinks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.380" end="00:47.060">And I'm successful she thinks, always comes around -</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.060" end="00:50.980">We - off and on, off and on, only ever really rock off and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.980" end="00:52.840">Never see her these days 'cause I'm often gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.840" end="00:55.280">When I'm home off tour, never stop for long</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.280" end="00:56.920">Back this week from across the pond</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.920" end="01:01.150">Noticed I was close to the block she's on, elevator to the floor her loft is on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.150" end="01:02.860">Drinking whiskey, she likes vodka strong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.860" end="01:06.910">But after we - it's over, walked out the door, that's closure (that's closure)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.910" end="01:10.850">No, I can't stay here and hold her, tomorrow act like I don't know her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.850" end="01:14.450">Wouldn't ever be here sober, can't tell which one is colder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.450" end="01:20.230">My clothing's on, we both did wrong, I gotta go that's what I told her, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.230" end="01:24.180">Ah, she said she can't feel her face (she said she can't feel her face)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.180" end="01:28.040">Yeah, right now I can't feel my heart (right now I can't feel my heart)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.040" end="01:31.990">Ah, for your feelings, there's no place (for your feelings, there's no place)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.990" end="01:35.620">Yeah, but you knew 'bout that from the start</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.620" end="01:39.440">You and I were made of glass, we'd never last (we'd never last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.440" end="01:43.280">You and I were made of glass, we'd never last (we'd never last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.280" end="01:47.350">Meant to die, we moved fast, and then we crashed (then we crashed)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.350" end="01:49.830">You and I were made of glass, we'd never last</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.830" end="01:54.230">She's fine as f-, but she knows it, sexy body she shows it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.230" end="01:57.880">Loves the drama she chose it, she draws the line then she blows it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.880" end="02:02.050">The most fun I suppose it, pops a bottle won't close it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.050" end="02:05.650">Fills a fifth, then she throws it, she pops a bar now she's dozing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.650" end="02:09.970">She's hot and cold, hot and cold, homie, I don't know she's hot and cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.970" end="02:13.720">Truly the bull- has gotten old, superficial with a rotten soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.720" end="02:15.710">F- off and on, always stop and go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.710" end="02:17.820">Probably got someone, choose not to know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.820" end="02:19.740">Head to her place then we lock the door</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.740" end="02:21.460">Making bad calls when I'm off the -</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.460" end="02:25.320">'Cause she's a -, I'm selfish, want every girl, can't help it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.320" end="02:29.220">And it's tough for me to shelf it, it's you I see myself with</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.220" end="02:33.330">Right now, I know you felt it, I touched her then she melted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.330" end="02:38.810">We shouldn't chill, but we do it still, gotta play the hand if you dealt it, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.810" end="02:42.770">Ah, she said she can't feel her face (she said she can't feel her face)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.770" end="02:46.820">Yeah, right now, I can't feel my heart (right now I can't feel my heart)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.820" end="02:50.730">Ah, for your feelings, there's no place (for your feelings, there's no place)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.730" end="02:53.930">Yeah, but you knew 'bout that from the start</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.930" end="02:58.180">You and I were made of glass, we'd never last (we'd never last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.180" end="03:02.050">You and I were made of glass, we'd never last (we'd never last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.050" end="03:06.090">Meant to die, we moved fast, and then we crashed (then we crashed)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.090" end="03:10.240">You and I were made of glass (we'd never last)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.240" end="03:18.090">Missing everything you say, it's not important what you stand for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.090" end="03:25.970">You're asking will he be the one, I'll be gone before you're done tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.970" end="03:33.880">Waiting for another day, you're not getting what you paid for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.880" end="03:41.880">Tryna salvage what's undone and deny you got outrun tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.380" end="03:51.900">Never knew her name, they're looking all the same to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:51.900" end="03:57.730">They only chase the fame, there's no one left to blame but me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:57.730" end="04:01.730" /></div></body></tt>